      "content": "but it doesnt feel like a symptom. it feels like the truth. like i've been erased. there's no one left to talk to, no one even checks in. i'm just a ghost in a room that everyone else walked out of. it feels so much more natural to just... be gone than to keep pretending i'm still part of something.",
