      "content": "it just feels like i'm stuck in this weird middle ground. like i'm dead to everyone else, but i still have to go through the motions of being alive. it's so exhausted. if i've already been erased from everyone's lives, what's even the point of the physical part? everything feels so hollow anyway.",
